    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n214.jpg">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="19" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/exodus_19_16/exodus_19"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/exodus_19_16/exodus_19/16" n="16"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:exodus/19/16">‘And it happened on the third day during the morning that there was thunder and lightning and a heavy cloud lay over the mountain and there was a very powerful sound of the Shofar and all the people in the camp were afraid’.</tei:seg> <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/>And it was said:  <tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="19" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/exodus_19_19/exodus_19"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/exodus_19_19/exodus_19/19" n="19"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:exodus/19/19">‘And the sound of the Shofar grew very powerful, Moses was speaking and God was answering him aloud’.</tei:seg> <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/>And it was said:  <tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="20" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/exodus_20_18/exodus_20"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/exodus_20_18/exodus_20/18" n="18"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:exodus/20/18">‘And all the people were seeing the thunder and the lightning and the</tei:seg> <tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n216.jpg" n="98"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:exodus/20/18">sound of the Shofar and the mountain in smoke, the people saw and trembled and stood at a distance’.</tei:seg> <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/>And in Thy holy words it is written saying:  <tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="47" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/psalms_47_6/psalms_47"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/psalms_47_6/psalms_47/6" n="6"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/47/6">‘God has arisen with Teruah, the Lord with a Shofar sound’.</tei:seg> <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/>And it was said:  <tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="98" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/psalms_98_6/psalms_98"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/psalms_98_6/psalms_98/6" n="6"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/98/6">‘with trumpets and the Shofar sound cry out before the King, the Lord’.</tei:seg> <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/>And it was said:  <tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="81" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/psalms_81_4/psalms_81"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/psalms_81_4/psalms_81/4" n="4"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/81/4">‘Blow the Shofar on the new moon, when the moon is covered, on the day of our festival,</tei:seg> <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="81" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/psalms_81_5/psalms_81"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/psalms_81_5/psalms_81/5" n="5"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/81/5">for it is a statute for Israel, a judgment for the God of Jacob’.</tei:seg> <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/>And it was said:  <tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="150" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/psalms_150_1/psalms_150"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/psalms_150_1/psalms_150/1" n="1"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/150/1">‘Halleluyah, praise God for His holiness, praise Him for the strong firmament.</tei:seg> <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="150" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/psalms_150_2/psalms_150"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/psalms_150_2/psalms_150/2" n="2"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/150/2">Praise Him for His mighty deeds, praise Him for the abundance of His greatness.</tei:seg> <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="150" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/psalms_150_3/psalms_150"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/psalms_150_3/psalms_150/3" n="3"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/150/3">Praise Him with the Shofar blast, praise Him with zither and the harp.</tei:seg> <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="150" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/psalms_150_4/psalms_150"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/psalms_150_4/psalms_150/4" n="4"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/150/4">Praise Him with timbrel and dance, praise Him with string instruments and flutes,</tei:seg> <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="150" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/psalms_150_5/psalms_150"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/psalms_150_5/psalms_150/5" n="5"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/150/5">praise Him with the clash of cymbals, praise Him with the ring of cymbals.</tei:seg> <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="150" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/psalms_150_6/psalms_150"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/psalms_150_6/psalms_150/6" n="6"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/150/6">Let all with breath praise the Lord, Halleluyah.</tei:seg> <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/>And through Thy servants the prophets it is written saying:  <tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="18" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/isaiah_18_3/isaiah_18"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/isaiah_18_3/isaiah_18/3" n="3"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:isaiah/18/3">‘all inhabitants of the world and dwellers on earth, when the banner is raised on the mountain shall you see and when the Shofar is blown shall you hear’.</tei:seg> <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/>And it was said:  <tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="27" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/isaiah_27_13/isaiah_27"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/isaiah_27_13/isaiah_27/13" n="13"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:isaiah/27/13">‘And on that day the great Shofar will be blown and the wanderers in the land of Assyria and the banished in the land of Egypt shall come and prostrate themselves to the Lord on the holy mountain in Jerusalem’.</tei:seg> <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/>And it was said:  <tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="9" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/zechariah_9_14/zechariah_9"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/zechariah_9_14/zechariah_9/14" n="14"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:zechariah/9/14">‘And the Lord will appear to them and His arrow shall go forth like lightning and the Lord God will blow the Shofar and He will walk in the whirlwinds of the south.</tei:seg> <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="9" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/zechariah_9_15/zechariah_9"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" n="15" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/zechariah_9_15/zechariah_9/15"/><tei:milestone unit="verse-part" n="adonai_tzevaot_yagen" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_verses/quotes/zechariah_9_15/zechariah_9/15/adonai_tzevaot_yagen"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:zechariah/9/15/adonai_tzevaot_yagen">The Lord of Hosts will protect them’.</tei:seg><tei:milestone unit="verse-part"/><tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/>  So mayest Thou protect Thy people Israel with Thy peace. </tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
